# paper/render_html.py output
paper/main.html

# pdflatex output. Deliberately NOT tracked, and the reason WAS the same
# one docs/80 section 4 gives about digests: there is no pdflatex on the
# development machine, so a committed PDF is a binary this repository
# cannot rebuild, cannot diff and cannot check against paper/main.tex.
# The published mirror's CI compiles it on every push and uploads it as
# a build artefact, which is where a downloadable copy comes from.
#
# BOTH HALVES OF THAT REASON FAILED, and it is worth writing down which
# way. 2026-09-14: tectonic 0.17.0 is now installed and `make -C paper`
# builds the PDF here, so "cannot rebuild" is no longer true. And CI has
# not started a job since 2026-09-10 -- the runs fail with zero steps
# executed, which is the account's Actions spending limit -- so "CI
# uploads it as a build artefact" has not been true either, and the
# consequence is that for four days there was NO downloadable copy of
# this paper anywhere.
#
# The file stays untracked: a binary in git is still not diffable, and
# that part of the argument never depended on the missing toolchain. The
# downloadable copy is a RELEASE ASSET on the mirror instead, built from
# a named revision, which is the form that says which source it came
# from.
paper/main.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
# `make -C paper arxiv` output. Untracked for the same reason as the PDF
# and for one more: it is a tarball of two files that are both already
# in this repository, so publishing it would put main.tex in the tree
# twice, once where it can be diffed and once where it cannot. It was
# committed by accident on 2026-09-14 -- the first `make arxiv` this
# repository has ever been able to run produced it, and nothing was
# ignoring a file that had never existed before. Caught by reading the
# mirror's staged file list rather than by any check, which is the
# reason this line exists instead of a note saying it was fine.
paper/arxiv.tar.gz
paper/*.out

# paper-residual build output, same reasoning as paper/
paper-residual/main.pdf
paper-residual/*.aux
paper-residual/*.bbl
paper-residual/*.blg
paper-residual/*.log
paper-residual/*.out
paper-residual/arxiv.tar.gz

